title: "Boundaries of Retail Quantitative Trading on Prediction Markets: A Multi-Mechanism Empirical Retrospective"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Stephen
    affiliation: "Abel AI Lab"
    email: lab@abel.ai
version: "v0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-06"
abstract: >-
  This repository packages the manuscript, data registries, and minimal
  reproduction checks for Paper 2 from Abel AI Lab. The paper maps observed
  boundaries of LLM-assisted retail prediction-market trading across 13 active
  campaigns and 156 instrumented rounds, with scope limited to a single-lab,
  single-period retrospective.
